fn gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_stroke_packed_mask_resource_software_drain_test_complete_owner %impure fn GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokePackedMaskResourceSoftwareDrainOwner impure fn i32 Option GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokePackedMaskResourceSoftwareDrainCompletedOwner \owner\fuel:
