fn gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_stroke_packed_mask_test_scan_to_completion %impure fn GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokeCoverageScanOwner impure fn i32 Option GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedStrokeCoverageCellOwner \owner\fuel:
